        <item>Every hand has a one-square piece.</item>
        <item>+3 pieces per stage.</item>
        <item>Lagoons score 50% more.</item>
        <item>Combos last 5 moves.</item>
        <item>A line made only of pearls scores ×3.</item>
        <item>Undo one move per stage.</item>
        <item>See the next hand.</item>
